<title>USA: Vishay Intertechnology sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Vishay Intertechnology sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vishay Intertechnology Inc said on Monday that its directors had declared a five percent stock dividend on both its common stock and Class B convertible common stock.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable on June 9 to stockholders of record on May 30, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares, the company added.</p>
<p>Vishay Intertechnology Inc, based in Malvern, Penn., is a manufacturer of passive electronic components.</p>
